-- N5 example sentences, batch 3: から〜まで, より, 〜ませんか, 〜ないでください,
-- 〜たことがある, 〜ながら, 〜前に, 〜後で, とき and 〜たら.
--
-- One more topic joins the blocked list from 058: けど cuts as け | ど, the same
-- way もいい and なければ do. That is now three N5 topics — 〜てもいい,
-- 〜なければなりません and けど — waiting on the tokeniser learning to read a
-- grammar pattern as one unit.
--
-- Two rewrites the checker forced, both the same trap: a verb's ます stem is
-- often also a noun, and the tokeniser takes the noun and strands the grammar.
-- 新聞を読みながら came apart as 読み | な | が | ら, so the sentence uses
-- 聞きながら instead. 少し休みましょう hit this in 056.
--
-- Additive, idempotent, safe on a live database.

  -- kara-made
